          <ul class="space-y-1.5 text-xs text-linen/80">
            <li>• City of Edmonton Licensed &amp; Background-Checked Specialists</li>
            <li>• 100% Pet &amp; Kid Safe Botanical Eucalyptus Formulas</li>
            <li>• Official Itemized Receipt Issued Upon Completion</li>
          </ul>
